{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109559","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109559/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109559/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109559/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109559","id":3316412235,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7FrG9L","number":109559,"title":"Can't find AdMob node unless parent node is renamed","user":{"login":"alee724","id":140758174,"node_id":"U_kgDOCGPMng","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140758174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724","html_url":"https://github.com/alee724","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-08-13T00:06:34Z","updated_at":"2025-08-13T11:28:39Z","closed_at":"2025-08-13T10:19:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\ngodot 4.4\n\n### System information\n\nMacOS\n\n### Issue description\n\nI am working with admob and I have had about 20 iterations where apps don't open because it cant find the AdMob node that is clearly there. Turns out changing the name of the parent node fixes it but still a very odd fix/issue. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI create a new scene with a node as root. I add an AdMob node as a child to that node, and then make a script attached to the root node for some functionality with AdMob. I then add this scene as an autoload and make use of it in my game Globally. The first time, it should work just fine when you try to export but when you try a second time its says that it can't find the AdMob node. If you rename the root node in the AdMob scene and try again it magically works. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMinimal reproduction would be as above. The main game can be just a button with a script to the functions in the autoloaded AdMob scene. ","closed_by":{"login":"alee724","id":140758174,"node_id":"U_kgDOCGPMng","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140758174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724","html_url":"https://github.com/alee724","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alee724/even